WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.460
This sentence assumes the reader already agrees.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.600
They do not.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:08.640
Earn it.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:09.940
Here.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.440
This line.

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:13.640
This is the one with a pulse.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.340
Everything else should be jealous of it.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.180
This is asserted, not demonstrated.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.400
What is the evidence, and where does it

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:24.020
come from?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.760
In order to.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.240
Cut it.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:28.560
To.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.280
Again, twice more below.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.080
I followed you for two paragraphs.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.820
Then, right here, I lost the thread.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:39.760
Five editors.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:40.960
One desk.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.180
Twyne.
